WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.202
- Freeze! police.

00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:04.804
Hands up.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:09.509
Turn around slowly.

00:00:14.213 --> 00:00:15.882
Okay, buddy.

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:18.952
Do not move a muscle.

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:25.225
Up! Up!
Get your hands back up.

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.059
No, raise them.

00:00:27.192 --> 00:00:29.496
Up, hands up, now!

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:33.199
No, no stop!

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.266
I said no moving.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.803
Put your foot down.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:38.938
That's good.

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:40.206
Now, easy does it. No!

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:41.573
Don't pick your other foot up!

00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:43.843
Put that down.
Put your foot down!

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:46.646
Put your foot down.
There we go.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.314
No, do not
pick the other one up.

00:00:48.447 --> 00:00:49.782
Put that one down.

00:00:49.915 --> 00:00:51.584
Put your foot down.
no, not--

00:00:51.717 --> 00:00:52.952
Put them both down
at the sa--okay.

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:55.688
Now you're just walking.
Stop walking!

00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:56.956
Now!

00:00:57.089 --> 00:00:58.358
St--no walking!

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:00.226
I want you to stop walking
right now.

00:01:00.359 --> 00:01:02.562
Do not get near that car.
Wait, get away from it.

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.397
No, don't go near that car.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:05.498
Don't open that door!

00:01:05.631 --> 00:01:07.199
Do not open that door!

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.234
Don't open it.

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:09.636
Do not open the car door!

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:11.537
Don't you open that door.

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:14.273
Don't! Do not get in that car.

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:15.641
Freeze!

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:17.443
Your butt better not
hit that seat.

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:20.012
The--okay.
stay--do--get out of there.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:22.582
Get out of the car right now.
No, you don't.

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:25.718
Don't you dare reach
for that glove compartment.

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:27.553
Don't reach for that
glove compartment!

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:29.522
Get away
from the glove compartment!

00:01:29.655 --> 00:01:30.590
Get your hand away
from the glove compartment!

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.291
Don't you open it!

00:01:32.424 --> 00:01:33.993
Do not grab that gun!

00:01:34.126 --> 00:01:36.262
Whatever you do, dude,
you better not grab that gun.

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:38.798
You better not
grab that gun.

00:01:38.931 --> 00:01:39.799
[panting]

00:01:39.932 --> 00:01:42.034
Do not pull that gun on me.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.202
Put that down!

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:44.403
Don't you pull that gun on me.

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:45.905
No, hey. put that down.

00:01:46.038 --> 00:01:47.140
Don't do it!

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:51.411
Damn it! God damn it!

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:54.414
[engine starts]

00:02:00.686 --> 00:02:01.952
Damn it. Not again.

